---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PassportPhotoPreflight from '../../components/PassportPhotoPreflight.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Passport Photo Requirements by Country — ExactSize"
  description="Check passport photo guidance by country and application path. Review official sources and locally inspect published file metadata without changing or uploading the image."
  path="/passport-photos/"
>
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Passport photo requirements vary by country</h1>
    <p class="lede">Choose the country and application path. See the issuing authority’s guidance, then run a limited advisory check on file properties that the official source actually publishes.</p>
  </div>

  <PassportPhotoPreflight />

  <section class="content prose">
    <h2>What this preflight can’t verify</h2>
    <p>A file check cannot confirm photo age, facial expression, lighting, background, capture conditions, paper quality, prior editing, applicant eligibility, or acceptance by a government system. Follow the linked official instructions and use the authority’s own checker where available.</p>
    <p>This page does not create a passport-photo export. It does not crop, resize, recompress, retouch, or upload the selected image.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
